{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9UdXJraXNoLUxhbmd1YWdlL011c2x1bSUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Muslum","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/cbY2IlnNk85MqaPWgPZyJUD4vnz.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tTvht2fWfecG8gcS5DKurxJjZdE.jpg","description":"A biopic about the Turkish vocal artist Müslüm Gürses. Born into a poor household, Muslum found his redemption in music from the initial trauma that lingered over his musical and personal life as internalizing the grief. He rose through his ashes of shattered dreams like a phoenix. He walked in darkness, sang songs filled with sorrow which stirred people's souls and created a cult following. They were calling him \"Baba\" (The Father).","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Drama","Music","Others"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"136 min","cast":["Timuçin Esen","Zerrin Tekindor","Ayça Bingöl","Erkan Can","Taner Ölmez","Erkan Avcı","Şahin Kendirci","Turgut Tunçalp"],"director":["Ketche","Can Ulkay"],"released":"2018-10-26T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Timuçin Esen","character":"Müslüm Gürses (Akbaş)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kjWFagwq3xzWjrvP7x8DiHHhAPp.jpg"},{"name":"Zerrin Tekindor","character":"Muhterem Nur","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7hzKdJuNDknwx4TLK4IrvloNrQ.jpg"},{"name":"Ayça Bingöl","character":"Emine Akbaş","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aaohH9jgiiSPyJyZ39m2ZSMVdZ1.jpg"},{"name":"Erkan Can","character":"Limoncu Ali","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oioTwnpigGCUR3LBGeqYQxp5DMt.jpg"},{"name":"Taner Ölmez","character":"Ahmet Akbaş","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/QG3bNfNw5aRqEzhttSIEey4nBt.jpg"},{"name":"Erkan Avcı","character":"Bahtiyar","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2SQBu38Hx4Yx2PM7OdKgbdz5UCd.jpg"},{"name":"Şahin Kendirci","character":"Genç Müslüm Gürses (Akbaş)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7jESd3qKcYs5Oiz0zbxXhTuF6Oo.jpg"},{"name":"Turg